WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.893
HTML uses tags to mark up content. Let's write your first page.

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:11.340
Most tags come in pairs: an opening tag, and a closing tag with a slash.

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:16.073
Use h1 for the main heading, and p for paragraphs.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.946
Use a for links, and img for images.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.473
Always add alt text, describing each image for people who cannot see it.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:37.408
Before you move on, check: Create index.html with a heading and paragraph. Add a link and an image with alt text. Open the page in your browser.

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:41.194
In the next lesson: CSS basics.
